66
00:07:17,812 --> 00:07:21,441
<i>...a belt, socks, underwear, a blazer...</i>

67
00:07:21,608 --> 00:07:25,111
<i>...a striped tie and a white bathrobe.</i>

68
00:07:31,743 --> 00:07:34,204
<i>He looked out the window.</i>

69
00:07:34,663 --> 00:07:37,207
<i>The unconscious bodies
of the captured loners...</i>

70
00:07:37,374 --> 00:07:39,709
<i>...were lying on the wet ground.</i>

71
00:07:40,126 --> 00:07:44,881
<i>"Thank God they wear
those waterproof ponchos," he thought.</i>

72
00:07:45,340 --> 00:07:51,596
Room 195. Two loners, two extra days.

73
00:07:54,099 --> 00:08:00,188
Room 272. One loner, one extra day.

74
00:08:13,702 --> 00:08:17,706
Hello. I'm the hotel manager
and this gentleman is my partner.

75
00:08:17,872 --> 00:08:20,709
We'd like to welcome you.
You're one of the lucky ones.

76
00:08:20,875 --> 00:08:24,004
You have one of our superior rooms,
which means you have a view.

77
00:08:24,170 --> 00:08:25,630
Did you read the leaflet?

78
00:08:25,797 --> 00:08:27,632
- Yes, I did.
- Very good.

79
00:08:27,799 --> 00:08:31,886
The fact that you'll turn into an animal
