115
00:12:00,053 --> 00:12:02,430
<i>Next to her sat her best friend.</i>

116
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:08,603
<i>He thanked the waiter
who served him his coffee...</i>

117
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:12,065
<i>...and thought about his wife
