121
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:25,411
<i>He then looked behind him
and saw a woman...</i>

122
00:12:25,578 --> 00:12:29,666
<i>...who he would later find out
was absolutely heartless.</i>

123
00:12:31,834 --> 00:12:33,795
<i>And some others
in the couples area...</i>

124
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:37,715
<i>...whom he'd never meet
during his stay at the hotel.</i>

125
00:12:40,551 --> 00:12:43,429
<i>That morning he was really hungry.</i>

126
00:12:43,596 --> 00:12:47,976
<i>He could have eaten a whole chicken,
but ate almost nothing.</i>

127
00:12:48,142 --> 00:12:51,271
- Hello.
- Hello.

128
00:12:51,437 --> 00:12:53,606
I decided to go for a walk
with my new friend.

129
00:12:53,773 --> 00:12:56,109
Let me introduce you. This is Robert.

130
00:12:56,276 --> 00:12:58,945
He stays in the room next to mine
and has a lisp.

131
00:12:59,112 --> 00:13:02,949
Pleased to meet you.
I'm staying in Room 101.

132
00:13:03,116 --> 00:13:06,077
I'm on the same floor. I'm 186.

133
00:13:06,244 --> 00:13:09,330
- Would you like to join us?
- Why not?

134
00:13:26,848 --> 00:13:29,517
One of these days
it's gonna be me on those yachts.

135
00:13:29,684 --> 00:13:31,728
What are those yachts?

136
00:13:31,894 --> 00:13:35,106
The final ordeal before letting you go,
