168
00:15:37,979 --> 00:15:40,523
Thank you, John.
You can return to your seat now.

169
00:15:49,866 --> 00:15:55,079
Let's move on to our next guest.
Room 104, Day 2.

170
00:16:01,711 --> 00:16:04,172
Hello, everyone.

171
00:16:05,047 --> 00:16:07,341
